  Headline and reel_script say Rs 7 crore of fake books were bought for the Coimbatore Periyar Arivulagam library; the article says Rs 7 crore relates to 70,674 suspicious books distributed across state libraries, not specifically the Gandhipuram library.
  Reel_script says 'ரூ. 190 கோடி நிதியில் வாங்கப்பட்டன' context is fine, but slide 1 states the books were bought for the Gandhipuram library with 190 crore, mixing the state-wide allocation with the single library.
  Reel_script says the 70,674 books 'இதுவரை அகற்றப்பட்டுள்ளன' (have been removed) and the caption says the Rs 7 crore amount is 'இந்தப் புத்தகங்களின் எண்ணிக்கை உயரக்கூடும்' - the article says the count may rise, but the Rs 7 crore/70,674 figures are described as detected suspicious books, and slide 1 mislabels the 70,674 as removed from the Gandhipuram library specifically.
